Origin of the bundled API snapshots (specs/):

- specs/timeweb.json — a normalized snapshot of the public Timeweb Cloud API
  documentation (OpenAPI), extracted with scripts/sync_specs.py.
- specs/selectel/*.json and specs/selectel-meta.json — normalized snapshots of the
  public Selectel API documentation (docs.selectel.ru/api/), extracted with
  scripts/sync_specs.py.
- specs/sweb.json — a normalized snapshot of the public SpaceWeb API documentation
  (apidoc.sweb.ru, OpenRPC documents inlined in the docs bundle). Extraction logic is
  ported from sanchpet/sweb-go-sdk (MIT, api-spec/gen).
- specs/tilda.json — hand-maintained snapshot of the public Tilda Publishing
  export API (api.tildacdn.com), written from the published documentation.

These snapshots contain reworked fragments of the respective providers' public API
documentation and are distributed solely to make the tool naming and parameter
schemas usable offline. All trademarks (Timeweb, Selectel, Tilda and their logos)
belong to their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or sponsored by Timeweb Cloud, Selectel, SpaceWeb or Tilda Publishing.

Runtime dependencies: mcp (MIT), httpx (BSD-3-Clause). Dev dependencies:
pytest (MIT), pytest-asyncio (Apache-2.0), respx (MIT), ruff (MIT).
